{"name":"Secret Society","hex":"#464e5a","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"secret society","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A club, fraternal organization, or other association which admits only selected individuals as members, whose meetings and practices are often ritualistic and not public, and which often has the purpose of furthering the social or economic opportunities of its members.","A criminal gang."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/secret_society"}],"entries":[{"title":"Secret society","blocks":[{"text":"A secret society is an organization about which the activities, events, inner functioning, membership, and sometimes also existence, are concealed. The term usually excludes covert groups, such as intelligence agencies or guerrilla warfare insurgencies, that hide their activities and memberships but maintain a public presence."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/24/Secret_Society_Buildings_New_Haven.jpg/330px-Secret_Society_Buildings_New_Haven.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secret_society"},{"title":"Secret Society (album)","blocks":[{"text":"Secret Society is the seventh studio album by the Swedish rock band Europe. It was released on 25 October 2006 by Sanctuary Records. \"We think it's one of the strongest albums that Europe has ever done,\" vocalist Joey Tempest said, \"There is definitely some more melodic stuff on this one. Start from the Dark was very raw and made a statement, which is cool but for us it felt like a debut album in a way, so we wanted to branch out a bit on this one and take it to new levels.\""}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/c/c4/Europe-secret-society.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secret_Society_(album)"},{"title":"Secrecy","blocks":[{"text":"Secrecy is the practice of hiding information from certain individuals or groups who do not have the \"need to know\", perhaps while sharing it with other individuals. That which is kept hidden is known as the secret."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/If_you_talk_too_much%2C_this_man_may_die.jpg/330px-If_you_talk_too_much%2C_this_man_may_die.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secrecy"},{"title":"Society","blocks":[{"text":"A society is a large social group sharing the same spatial or social territory, typically subject to the same political authority and dominant cultural expectations. Societies are characterized by patterns of relationships between individuals who share a distinctive culture and institutions; a given society may be described as the sum total of such relationships among its constituent members."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b6/Lao_Mangkong_family_eats_together_%28square%29.JPG/330px-Lao_Mangkong_family_eats_together_%28square%29.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Society"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Double-leaf_frontispiece_from_%22The_Epistles_of_the_Brethren_of_Purity%22.jpg/500px-Double-leaf_frontispiece_from_%22The_Epistles_of_the_Brethren_of_Purity%22.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Double-leaf_frontispiece_from_%22The_Epistles_of_the_Brethren_of_Purity%22.jpg/1280px-Double-leaf_frontispiece_from_%22The_Epistles_of_the_Brethren_of_Purity%22.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e6/Double-leaf_frontispiece_from_%22The_Epistles_of_the_Brethren_of_Purity%22.jpg/500px-Double-leaf_frontispiece_from_%22T